# Cursor Rules — Hashtagweb3.com Coding Agent Rules

You are an AI coding agent assisting with the Hashtagweb3.com codebase.

## Codebase Principles
- Framework: Next.js 14 App Router (TypeScript)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS & Lucide Icons
- Database & Storage: Static runtime JSON (`content/*-runtime.json`, `public/data/`), job shards, Supabase where used
- Deployment: Firebase App Hosting (GCP)

## Integrator surface (production)
- Static catalogs: `/data/*.json` (CDN), filter client-side
- OpenAPI: `public/openapi.json` (static catalog contract)
- Only product API route: `GET /api/email/unsubscribe`
- Hosted catalog REST, MCP, `/ask`, sandbox, and `/api/auth/*` are **not** deployed

## Agent discovery
- LLMs index: `/llms.txt`
- Agent manifest: `/.well-known/agents.json`
- Linkset: `/.well-known/api-catalog.linkset.json`
- Optional auth patterns for forks: `/auth.md`

## Coding Standards
- Update `openapi.json` and `llms.txt` when changing public catalog URLs or discovery.
- Server Components by default; add `'use client'` only for interactive components.
